WEBVTT

01:46.000 --> 01:48.210
GWARGH!

01:48.210 --> 01:49.710
GWWAARGHH!

01:49.960 --> 01:52.090
Have a light.

01:52.090 --> 01:53.090
Here!

01:53.090 --> 01:55.720
GWARGHHH!

03:02.320 --> 03:04.080
AIIYEEEARGH!

03:04.080 --> 03:05.580
YEEART!

03:05.580 --> 03:06.240
GWARGH!

03:07.410 --> 03:09.410
Hurry! Go!

03:14.170 --> 03:16.670
SAYŌNARA!

03:20.010 --> 03:22.140
Die, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

03:22.140 --> 03:23.640
WASSHOI!

03:24.180 --> 03:24.800
YEEART!

03:24.800 --> 03:25.180
YEEART!!

03:25.180 --> 03:26.220
HUWAARGH!

03:26.220 --> 03:27.520
YEEART! YEEART!

03:27.520 --> 03:28.560
AIYEARGH!

03:28.560 --> 03:30.390
Damn it! It's no good!

03:30.390 --> 03:31.980
SAYŌNARA!

03:34.060 --> 03:35.110
YEEART!

03:35.110 --> 03:37.230
NINJAS must be slain!

03:41.950 --> 03:43.610
AIYEARGH!

03:43.610 --> 03:47.120
Save me, YAKUZA TENGU-SAN!

03:49.450 --> 03:51.290
The Executor of Justice!

03:51.290 --> 03:54.130
YAKUZA TENGU is here!

03:54.130 --> 03:56.340
DŌMO, YAKUZA TENGU-SAN.

03:56.340 --> 03:57.420
I am Green ELEPH—

03:56.340 --> 03:57.420
NOTE: An ELEPHANT is—

03:57.420 --> 03:59.340
Screw you, asshole!

03:57.420 --> 03:59.340
NOTE: —oh. Never mind.

04:04.430 --> 04:10.220
The NINJA lifted up the staff, and struck the water that was in the Nile.

04:11.980 --> 04:15.060
I'm sorry. I'm truly sorry.

04:15.060 --> 04:19.360
I shall send all of you back to JIGOKU.

04:19.780 --> 04:25.360
Because that day, I was the one who released you.

04:27.370 --> 04:28.790
NINJA...

04:28.790 --> 04:32.410
You must pay the reward as well!

04:32.410 --> 04:38.250
If you can't, I'll take you to the land of TENGU!

04:47.180 --> 04:47.680
YEEART!

04:48.100 --> 04:49.260
GWARGH!

04:49.260 --> 04:52.100
SAYŌNARA!

04:54.730 --> 04:59.150
This was for the best... Morita-SAN.

05:03.900 --> 05:08.530
A man like me was destined to end up this way.

05:08.530 --> 05:13.580
Will you grant me KAISHAKU,
NINJA Slayer-SAN?

05:15.830 --> 05:18.880
Listen... go to Chabu.

05:18.880 --> 05:21.340
Meet with Mainichi-SAN.

05:21.340 --> 05:31.510
I'm sure he already knows where Yukano-SAN is.

05:31.510 --> 05:32.930
SAYŌNARA!

05:50.490 --> 05:52.910
чёрт! йога штаны.

05:50.490 --> 05:52.910
NOTE: This is probably RUSSIAN.

05:52.910 --> 05:54.410
SAYŌNARA!

05:55.040 --> 05:56.080
YEEART!

06:16.390 --> 06:18.770
DŌMO, Dark NINJA-SAN.

06:18.770 --> 06:20.310
I am NINJA Slayer.

06:20.310 --> 06:22.690
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

06:22.690 --> 06:24.320
I am Dark NINJA.

06:24.320 --> 06:25.940
I'm a bit busy now.

06:25.940 --> 06:27.360
GWARRGGH!

06:27.820 --> 06:30.620
QUICKSILVER-SAN will be your opponent.

06:30.620 --> 06:33.030
GWARGHHH!

06:33.870 --> 06:34.700
Farewell!

06:37.410 --> 06:38.710
YEEART!

06:42.250 --> 06:46.260
Laomoto-SAN... loyalty... loyalty...

06:46.260 --> 06:49.180
My loyalty... SAYŌNARA!

07:02.270 --> 07:04.900
Fuyuko! Tochinoki!

07:09.360 --> 07:10.660
That day...

07:10.660 --> 07:13.030
That day... why did I...

07:13.370 --> 07:15.530
Fuyuko! Tochinoki!

07:21.250 --> 07:23.290
Why did I... that day...

07:23.790 --> 07:25.960
Fuyuko! Tochinoki!

07:25.960 --> 07:28.760
YEEART!

07:39.230 --> 07:40.640
GWARGH!

07:42.060 --> 07:45.110
<i>My spine... Is that a fatal wound?</i>

07:54.240 --> 07:57.080
DŌMO, Sonic BOOM-SAN.

07:59.040 --> 08:00.710
I am Yamoto Koki.

08:06.040 --> 08:07.670
A psychic?

08:07.670 --> 08:09.920
Not bad for a goddamn kid.

08:09.920 --> 08:13.090
But there are plenty of psychic NINJAS.

08:26.110 --> 08:28.940
This is the end of the line.

08:45.000 --> 08:46.880
Check!

08:46.880 --> 08:48.920
NNUUUUUUUUUU...

08:46.880 --> 08:48.920
NOTE: This is the sound of NINJA concentration.

08:48.920 --> 08:51.090
NNUUUUUUUUUU...

08:51.090 --> 08:53.130
NNUUUUUUU...

09:29.290 --> 09:30.710
YEEART!

09:29.710 --> 09:30.710
GWARGH!

09:30.710 --> 09:34.510
I don't want to play SHŌGI with you!

09:36.590 --> 09:37.930
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

09:39.930 --> 09:42.680
Are you there?

09:42.680 --> 09:47.480
My son, Hitori, works for MURASAKI SHIKIBU Cosmetics in KYŌTO.

09:47.940 --> 09:50.730
It's been a long time, Dad.

09:50.730 --> 09:51.980
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

09:51.980 --> 09:54.740
Hitori... you can't—

09:55.610 --> 09:59.910
Dad, thanks to you, I got a job I can be proud of.

10:00.200 --> 10:01.370
Thanks.

10:04.700 --> 10:07.670
I'm not even Mifune Hitori anymore.

10:07.670 --> 10:09.920
I'm just DEADMOON.

10:09.920 --> 10:13.250
You're no different, are you,
NINJA Slayer-SAN?

10:24.350 --> 10:26.640
I'm starting to figure this out.

10:26.640 --> 10:28.730
Screw you, bitch!

10:28.730 --> 10:29.560
TAKE THIS!

10:33.900 --> 10:36.240
DŌMO, CHUPACABRA-SAN!

10:36.240 --> 10:38.740
No, President Chabeta.

10:38.740 --> 10:41.120
I am NINJA Slayer.

10:41.120 --> 10:42.700
MOO!

10:41.120 --> 10:42.700
NOTE: This is COW LANGUAGE.

10:46.290 --> 10:50.500
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.
I am CHUPACABRA.

10:50.790 --> 10:51.790
YEEART!

10:56.090 --> 10:59.380
You are no longer a human nor even a CHUPACABRA!

10:59.380 --> 11:01.050
You are just a NINJA!

11:01.050 --> 11:03.100
And NINJAS must be slain!

11:03.100 --> 11:04.050
YEEART!

11:04.050 --> 11:06.600
SAYŌNARA!

11:13.730 --> 11:16.980
DŌMO. I am NINJA Slayer.

11:16.980 --> 11:18.400
Why did you kill them?!

11:18.400 --> 11:21.200
DŌMO. I am Dark NINJA.

11:21.200 --> 11:24.620
There is a massive, well-oiled control system of darkness

11:24.620 --> 11:28.120
that a rabid dog like you could never understand.

11:28.120 --> 11:29.790
Then I'll use my KARATE!

11:29.790 --> 11:32.080
I have no time for you.

11:32.080 --> 11:33.080
YEEART!

11:38.710 --> 11:40.420
I won't let you get away this time!

11:40.420 --> 11:41.470
You mad dog!

11:47.100 --> 11:51.890
Did you enjoy the battles between NINJA Slayer and the NINJAS?

11:51.890 --> 11:56.690
NINJA Slayer's fantastic battles will continue!

11:56.690 --> 11:57.730
SATSUBATSU!
